{"ticker":"OMC","updated":"2026-10-30T23:03:45Z","profile":{"longName":"Omnicom Group Inc.","shortName":"Omnicom Group Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.omc.com","fullTimeEmployees":120000,"marketCap":22293352448,"trailingPE":82.08081,"forwardPE":7.294114,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.9004868,"pegRatio":15.97,"targetMeanPrice":101.41667,"targetHighPrice":130.0,"targetLowPrice":77.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.591,"earningsGrowth":0.36,"grossMargins":0.19332,"operatingMargins":0.15725,"profitMargins":0.028469998,"totalRevenue":24757000192,"beta":0.703,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":89.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":66.33,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.95},"summary":"Omnicom Group Inc., together with its subsidiaries, offers advertising, marketing, and corporate communications services. It provides a range of services in the areas of media and advertising, precision marketing, public relations, healthcare, branding and retail commerce, experiential, execution, and support. The company's services include advertising, branding, content marketing, crisis communications, customer data analytics and data-driven decision making, customer relationship management, decision sciences, digital experience design, digital transformation, e-commerce optimization, entertainment marketing, experiential marketing, field marketing, healthcare marketing and communications, in-store design, investor relations, and marketing research.Its services also comprise media planning and buying, merchandising and point of sale, mobile marketing, multi-cultural marketing, organizational communications, package design, performance marketing, product placement, promotional marketing, public affairs, public relations, retail media and e-commerce, shopper marketing, structured innovation, studio production, social media and influencer marketing, and sports and event marketing. It operates in the North and Latin America, Europe, the Middle East and Africa (EMEA), and the Asia Pacific. The company was incorporated in 1944 and is based in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"宏盟集團及其子公司提供廣告、行銷和企業傳播服務。它在媒體和廣告、精準行銷、公共關係、醫療保健、品牌和零售商務、體驗、執行和支援領域提供一系列服務。該公司的服務包括廣告、品牌、內容行銷、危機溝通、客戶數據分析和數據驅動決策、客戶關係管理、決策科學、數位體驗設計、數位轉型、電子商務優化、娛樂行銷、體驗式行銷、現場行銷、醫療保健行銷和傳播、店內設計、投資者關係和行銷研究。其服務還包括媒體規劃和購買、商品推銷和銷售點、行動行銷、多元文化行銷、組織傳播、包裝設計、績效行銷、產品植入、促銷行銷、公共服務。事務、公共關係、零售媒體和電子商務、購物者行銷、結構化創新、工作室製作、社交媒體和影響者行銷以及體育和活動行銷。該公司在北美和拉丁美洲、歐洲、中東和非洲 (EMEA) 以及亞太地區開展業務。該公司成立於 1944 年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"廣告公司","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":77.07,"h":78.2,"l":76.64,"c":76.93,"v":4341800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":76.94,"h":77.75,"l":76.41,"c":77.53,"v":2740400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":77.6,"h":78.56,"l":76.59,"c":78.54,"v":2828400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":78.52,"h":80.22,"l":78.52,"c":79.43,"v":2729900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":79.19,"h":79.38,"l":77.66,"c":78.94,"v":4272000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":78.64,"h":78.91,"l":77.44,"c":77.73,"v":2789600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":77.5,"h":77.5,"l":75.31,"c":76.0,"v":2964400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":76.1,"h":77.86,"l":75.82,"c":77.84,"v":2372400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":77.57,"h":77.95,"l":75.65,"c":77.2,"v":3292500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":77.5,"h":77.66,"l":76.64,"c":76.85,"v":2132600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":76.81,"h":77.56,"l":75.99,"c":76.9,"v":2342900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":76.75,"h":78.45,"l":76.3,"c":76.6,"v":2893000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.7,"h":77.21,"l":75.83,"c":76.04,"v":2408900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":75.89,"h":76.25,"l":74.07,"c":75.01,"v":8425700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":74.9,"h":75.43,"l":74.47,"c":74.53,"v":2450700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":76.06,"h":77.64,"l":75.55,"c":76.28,"v":3390900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":76.02,"h":77.26,"l":76.0,"c":77.07,"v":2265700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":76.8,"h":76.85,"l":75.37,"c":75.88,"v":2613000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":75.82,"h":77.19,"l":75.71,"c":77.05,"v":2556900},{"t":"2025-09-29"