wyaS1pWUVWWVNBOUhnTUJaU05VMElsS2x1?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"宏盟與IPG交易“基本完成”，集團贏得可口可樂北美媒體"},{"title":"OMC Q3 deep dive: Integration synergies and media growth drive margin expansion","src":"The Globe and Mail","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"OMC 第三季深入探討：整合綜效和媒體成長推動利潤率擴張"},{"title":"Earnings call transcript: Omnicom tops Q3 2026 estimates and lifts margins","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNZlRDbHFrUnRSSEg0TGoyTFRUNEV2VlJZYjgyeVlHZ2tseHRNc2JRczl0MzdkOURLNUtySVNwOWw0a0hadVRLazZJVGJ4TDViWDljSDZseE52SVdJYVk2ZkhqVFBjN1JGOVk3emJhUUF5alZPX2RWbFdUTXo3czcxbmh3Y3FGYUhETkZzVXBRVi0tSGYwMXU4ankyTU5GbGtuTlpPYVMwY3pJbmpuaFA3WFRTMFlsTXp0TVhFb09wV2lmdVRNci14LQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"財報電話會議紀錄：宏盟集團 2026 年第三季業績超乎預期並提高利潤率"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/29989/000002998926000006/omc-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"On November 26, 2025 (the \"Closing Date\"), Omnicom completed its Merger with IPG (the \"Merger\"). As previously reported, on December 8, 2024, Omnicom entered into an Agreement and Plan of Merger (the \"Merger Agreement\") with IPG and EXT Subsidiary Inc., a Delaware corporation and a direct wholly owned subsidiary of Omnicom (\"Merger Sub\"). On the Closing Date, pursuant to the terms and conditions of the Merger Agreement, Merger Sub merged with and into IPG, with IPG continuing as the surviving corporation and a direct wholly owned subsidiary of Omnicom. Upon the Merger, each outstanding share of IPG common stock (other than certain excluded shares) converted into the right to receive 0.344 shares of Omnicom common stock and cash in lieu of fractional shares. Following the closing of the Merger, legacy Omnicom shareholders owned approximately 60.6% of the combined company and legacy IPG sh","zh":"2025 年 11 月 26 日（「交割日」），Omnicom 完成了與 IPG 的合併（「合併」）。如先前報道，2024 年 12 月 8 日，Omnicom 與 IPG 和 EXT Subsidiary Inc.（一家特拉華州公司、Omnicom 的直接全資子公司）（「合併子公司」）簽訂了一份協議和合併計劃（「合併協議」）。在交割日，根據合併協議的條款和條件，合併子公司與 IPG 合併，IPG 繼續作為存續公司和 Omnicom 的直接全資子公司。合併後，每股已發行的 IPG 普通股（某些除外股份除外）將轉換為獲得 0.344 股 Omnicom 普通股和現金代替零碎股份的權利。合併完成後，傳統 Omnicom 股東擁有合併後公司約 60.6% 的股份，而傳統 IPG 則持有合併後公司約 60.6% 的股份。"},{"en":"Omnicom's common stock continues to trade on the New York Stock Exchange, or NYSE, under the symbol \"OMC,\" and IPG's common stock has ceased trading. The Merger qualified as a tax-free reorganization for U.S. federal income tax purposes, and the combined company operates under the Omnicom name with headquarters in New York, New York. Omnicom is the acquirer of IPG under U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (U.S. GAAP), and as a result, the consolidated financial statements of Omnicom for periods prior to the Closing Date do not include the results of operations, financial position, or cash flows of IPG. The results of operations of IPG are included in Omnicom's consolidated financial statements only from the Closing Date forward. Accordingly, Omnicom's results of operations, financial condition and cash flows after the Closing Date are not comparable to prior periods due to the ","zh":"Omnicom 的普通股繼續在紐約證券交易所 (NYSE) 交易，代號為“OMC”，而 IPG 的普通股已停止交易。此次合併符合美國聯邦所得稅目的的免稅重組，合併後的公司以 Omnicom 名義運營，總部位於紐約州紐約市。 Omnicom 是根據美國公認會計準則 (U.S. GAAP) 規定的 IPG 收購方，因此，交割日之前的 Omnicom 合併財務報表不包括 IPG 的營運結果、財務狀況或現金流量。 IPG 的經營績效僅從截止日期起納入 Omnicom 的合併財務報表。因此，交割日後宏盟的經營業績、財務狀況和現金流量與先前期間不可比，因為"},{"en":"In connection with the Merger, Omnicom commenced offers to exchange all outstanding notes of certain series issued by IPG for up to $2.95 billion in aggregate principal amount of new notes issued by Omnicom. As a result of these exchange offers, which were completed on December 2, 2025, approximately 94% of IPG's outstanding senior notes were exchanged for $2.76 billion in aggregate principal amount of new notes issued by Omnicom. The remaining approximately 6% of IPG's senior notes that were not tendered for exchange by holders remain outstanding obligations of IPG, a wholly owned subsidiary of Omnicom (see Note 7 to the consolidated financial statements).","zh":"在合併過程中，Omnicom 開始提出以 IPG 發行的某些系列的所有未償還票據交換 Omnicom 發行的新票據本金總額高達 29.5 億美元的要約。這些交換要約於 2025 年 12 月 2 日完成，IPG 約 94% 的已發行優先票據被交換為 Omnicom 發行的本金總額為 27.6 億美元的新票據。未由持有人交換的 IPG 優先票據中剩餘約 6% 仍為 Omnicom 全資子公司 IPG 的未償債務（請參閱合併財務報表附註 7）。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Advertising","val":10015900000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"Precision Marketing","val":1938500000,"zh":"精準行銷"},{"name":"Publicrelations","val":1613600000,"zh":"公關"},{"name":"Health Care","val":1379900000,"zh":"衛生保健"},{"name":"Experiential","val":862700000,"zh":"體驗式"},{"name":"Execution Support","val":843700000,"zh":"執行支援"},{"name":"Commerce & Branding","val":617600000,"zh":"商業與品牌"}],"total":17271900000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":10132400000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"North America","val":9592200000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":9102500000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":5214100000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Europe","val":4804900000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1925400000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":540200000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"Middle Eastand Africa","val":409200000,"zh":"中東和非洲"}],"total":17271900000}},"peers":["NTRS","NWSA","RHI","PNW","PFG"]}}